#  along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.
#
# Supported Operating Systems:
# Ubuntu server 26.04 only (64bit)
#
# Contributions from:
#
#   Anthony DeBeaulieu (anthony.d@sentora.org)
#   TGagtes 
#   Pascal Peyremorte (ppeyremorte@sentora.org)
#   Mehdi Blagui
